# [FABLE-5] sq-hmd7l.10 — vendored ORE-style CONSISTENCY task (expected: CONSISTENT).
# Hand-authored, hand-verified ALCH university ontology in the shape of an ORE
# competition consistency task (the real ORE 2014/2015 corpora are gather-only downloads
# — big corpora stay out of git). Exercises subClassOf, disjointness, an existential, a
# role hierarchy, a universal with a UNION filler (⊔-branching), and ABox assertions.
#
# Hand model: alice ∈ Professor ⊑ Person with a fresh teaches-successor in Course;
# bob ∈ Student ⊑ Person with involvedWith-successor cs101, and the ∀involvedWith
# filler (Course ⊔ Person) is satisfied by cs101 ∈ Course. No clash is derivable.
@prefix : <http://sparq.dev/bench/ore-smoke/univ#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

:Professor rdfs:subClassOf :Person .
:Student rdfs:subClassOf :Person .
:Person owl:disjointWith :Course .
:Professor rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :teaches ;
                             owl:someValuesFrom :Course ] .
:teaches rdfs:subPropertyOf :involvedWith .
:Student rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ; owl:onProperty :involvedWith ;
                           owl:allValuesFrom [ owl:unionOf ( :Course :Person ) ] ] .

:alice a :Professor .
:bob a :Student .
:bob :involvedWith :cs101 .
:cs101 a :Course .
